  "caveats": [
    "Government overview examples are summaries, not complete or exhaustive specific expectations.",
    "Ontario Strand A is cross-cutting social-emotional learning and mathematical processes; do not generate deterministic mastery credit from its presence.",
    "Ontario Grade 6 official page notes the ministry has asked schools since 2021–22 not to assess, evaluate or report on overall SEL expectations while continuing instruction; independently verify policy applicability before assessment design.",
    "Coding, modelling and financial literacy require separate jurisdiction-specific alignment, even if mathematical prerequisites are shared with US curricula.",
    "A blank overview example is not proof a grade omits that strand; all six strands are present in every grade.",
    "Mihur existing Ontario elementary packs and seed sources have not yet been exhaustively reconciled in this file."
  ],
